{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19484","headline":"吴方之见示听江西故吏朱幼恭歌三篇颇有怀故林之想吟讽不足因而和之 · 刘禹锡","name":"吴方之见示听江西故吏朱幼恭歌三篇颇有怀故林之想吟讽不足因而和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侯家故吏歌声发，逸处能高怨处低。\n今岁洛中无雨雪，眼前风景是江西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}